 ofvJb lIDy YIauu gGlNh ARCOA kyjTO xqlN gWRci aNnIu GDslh LjPJo UDizh gHvnI RpDvg YYtC rTpcz EDgo UVTAB hswTp sXtkB AAqU fctVp ENhiS xjUSk NatTH NqeUA dZTKY QMxMQ LpcJi wardV kcRqD fhCRd MYLFX RkJsE iEOQC yaNWn ZUpvj HoXXr " data-testid="prism-ImageViewer_ExpandButton" type="button"><span class="CSJky HNIED JSFPu "><svg aria-hidden="true" class=" " data-testid="prism-iconography" height="1em" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" data-icon="view-fullscreenEnter"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.48 11.24V16h3.04V9.52H16V6.48H6.48v4.76M32 8v1.52h6.48V16h3.04V6.48H32V8M6.48 36.76v4.76H16v-3.04H9.52V32H6.48v4.76m32-1.52v3.24H32v3.04h9.52V32h-3.04v3.24"/></svg></span></button><figcaption><div class="nMMea bNYiy Mjgpa dGwha DDmxa jgKNG RGHCC aBIU PriDW aiQHS lZur " data-testid="prism-caption"><div class="HXPPJ barbu yKsXL IzgMt VcHIt uhSzI YGNMU cRAsZ xqMcl QtRul "><span class="hsDdd OOSI GpQCA lZur VlFaz " data-testid="prism-truncate"><span><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ ">Sedimentary layers in Badlands National Park, South Dakota</span></span></span></div><div class="qinlA IpWvx oqZz tylGM lyWxS nWcVF UhTug PPcLh YxlyB "><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ YNujN JGtjI aZFDu rkKLh ">Photograph by Jonathan Irish</span></div></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><p class="EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy ">Badlands National Park<!-- --> <!-- -->is made up of jagged and striped rock formations. Before it was seized by the U.S. government in the 1920s, the land was inhabited and seen as sacred by the Oglala Lakota Sioux tribe.<!-- --> </p><h2 class="RxNCg SbJgJ ykkUm PvZ nIjPJ PMXYp LmsHF SfAHY mNgye lNbol LBPRq rBLIK ">47.<!-- --> <a class="zZygg UbGlr iFzkS qdXbA WCDhQ DbOXS tqUtK GpWVU iJYzE " data-testid="prism-linkbase" href="https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/national-parks/article/glacier-national-park" target="_blank" dir="ltr">Glacier National Park</a>, Montana</h2><div class="oLzSq QrHMO fnRUo pvsTF EhJPu vPlOC zNYgW OsTsW RMeqy daRVX ISNQ sKyCY eRftA acPPc MENS nFwaT MCnQE mEeeY SmBjI xegrY rPLsU iulOd NIuqO zzscu lzDCc aHUBM IEgzD OjMNy eQqcx SVqKB GQmdz jaoD VWDdR ONJdw vrZxD OnRTz gbbfF roDbV GPGwb oMlSS gfNzt oJhud eXZcf zhVlX "><div><div class="InlineImage GpQCA lZur asrEW " data-testid="prism-inline-image"><figure class="kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO " data-testid="prism-figure"><div class="GpQCA lZur " style="padding-bottom:66.66666666666666%" data-testid="prism-ratio-frame"><div class="FvQLF iLTd NqeUA UzzHi iWsMV "><div class="lZur TmzDJ bmjsw " data-testid="prism-copyright-wrapper"><picture data-testid="prism-picture"><source media="(max-width: 374px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=374&amp;h=249, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=748&amp;h=498 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 375px) and (max-width: 413px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=413&amp;h=275, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=826&amp;h=550 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 414px) and (max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=767&amp;h=511, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=1534&amp;h=1022 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=1024&amp;h=683, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=2048&amp;h=1366 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1440px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=1440&amp;h=960&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=2880&amp;h=1920&amp;q=90 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1441px) and (max-width: 1920px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1280&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=3840&amp;h=2560&amp;q=90 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1921px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=2500&amp;h=1667&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg?w=5000&amp;h=3334&amp;q=90 2x"/><img alt="St. Mary Lake in Glacier National Park, Montana" class="ArticleBodyLazyImg hsDdd NDJZt sJeUN IJwXl vBqtr UbGlr SjwtZ " data-testid="prism-image" draggable="false" loading="lazy" src="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/128e2f08-c16e-412b-ae1d-161c64bd97d7/glacier-national-park-st-mary-lake.jpg" id="Glacier National Park, Montana" decoding="async"/></picture></div></div></div><button aria-label="Open image in fullscreen" class="mLASH egFzk qXWHA ScoIf XbEWk jIRH nkbp OJpwZ hUQGO wSPfd ofvJb lIDy YIauu gGlNh ARCOA kyjTO xqlN gWRci aNnIu GDslh LjPJo UDizh gHvnI RpDvg YYtC rTpcz EDgo UVTAB hswTp sXtkB AAqU fctVp ENhiS xjUSk NatTH NqeUA dZTKY QMxMQ LpcJi wardV kcRqD fhCRd MYLFX RkJsE iEOQC yaNWn ZUpvj HoXXr " data-testid="prism-ImageViewer_ExpandButton" type="button"><span class="CSJky HNIED JSFPu "><svg aria-hidden="true" class=" " data-testid="prism-iconography" height="1em" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" data-icon="view-fullscreenEnter"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.48 11.24V16h3.04V9.52H16V6.48H6.48v4.76M32 8v1.52h6.48V16h3.04V6.48H32V8M6.48 36.76v4.76H16v-3.04H9.52V32H6.48v4.76m32-1.52v3.24H32v3.04h9.52V32h-3.04v3.24"/></svg></span></button><figcaption><div class="nMMea bNYiy Mjgpa dGwha DDmxa jgKNG RGHCC aBIU PriDW aiQHS lZur " data-testid="prism-caption"><div class="HXPPJ barbu yKsXL IzgMt VcHIt uhSzI YGNMU cRAsZ xqMcl QtRul "><span class="hsDdd OOSI GpQCA lZur VlFaz " data-testid="prism-truncate"><span><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ ">St. Mary Lake in Glacier National Park, Montana</span></span></span></div><div class="qinlA IpWvx oqZz tylGM lyWxS nWcVF UhTug PPcLh YxlyB "><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ YNujN JGtjI aZFDu rkKLh ">Photograph by Jonathan Irish</span></div></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><p class="EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy ">A quick stop off of the famed Going-to-the-Sun Road brings visitors to one of the most popular stops in the park—the view of St. Mary Lake from Wild Goose Scenic Viewpoint. Together with Waterton Lakes National Park in Canada,<!-- --> <!-- -->Glacier National Park<!-- --> <!-- -->makes up the world’s first international peace park.<!-- --> </p><div class="oLzSq QrHMO fnRUo pvsTF EhJPu vPlOC zNYgW OsTsW RMeqy daRVX ISNQ sKyCY eRftA acPPc MENS nFwaT MCnQE mEeeY SmBjI xegrY rPLsU iulOd NIuqO zzscu lzDCc aHUBM IEgzD OjMNy eQqcx SVqKB GQmdz jaoD VWDdR ONJdw vrZxD OnRTz gbbfF roDbV GPGwb oMlSS gfNzt oJhud eXZcf zhVlX "><div class="natgeo-ad" data-testid="prism-ad-wrapper" style="min-width:320px;min-height:50px;tran