s-national-park.jpg" id="Indiana Dunes National Park, Indiana" decoding="async"/></picture></div></div></div><button aria-label="Open image in fullscreen" class="mLASH egFzk qXWHA ScoIf XbEWk jIRH nkbp OJpwZ hUQGO wSPfd ofvJb lIDy YIauu gGlNh ARCOA kyjTO xqlN gWRci aNnIu GDslh LjPJo UDizh gHvnI RpDvg YYtC rTpcz EDgo UVTAB hswTp sXtkB AAqU fctVp ENhiS xjUSk NatTH NqeUA dZTKY QMxMQ LpcJi wardV kcRqD fhCRd MYLFX RkJsE iEOQC yaNWn ZUpvj HoXXr " data-testid="prism-ImageViewer_ExpandButton" type="button"><span class="CSJky HNIED JSFPu "><svg aria-hidden="true" class=" " data-testid="prism-iconography" height="1em" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" data-icon="view-fullscreenEnter"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.48 11.24V16h3.04V9.52H16V6.48H6.48v4.76M32 8v1.52h6.48V16h3.04V6.48H32V8M6.48 36.76v4.76H16v-3.04H9.52V32H6.48v4.76m32-1.52v3.24H32v3.04h9.52V32h-3.04v3.24"/></svg></span></button><figcaption><div class="nMMea bNYiy Mjgpa dGwha DDmxa jgKNG RGHCC aBIU PriDW aiQHS lZur " data-testid="prism-caption"><div class="HXPPJ barbu yKsXL IzgMt VcHIt uhSzI YGNMU cRAsZ xqMcl QtRul "><span class="hsDdd OOSI GpQCA lZur VlFaz " data-testid="prism-truncate"><span><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ ">Indiana Dunes National Park, Indiana</span></span></span></div><div class="qinlA IpWvx oqZz tylGM lyWxS nWcVF UhTug PPcLh YxlyB "><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ YNujN JGtjI aZFDu rkKLh ">Jacqueline Kehoe</span></div></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><p class="EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy ">The<!-- --> <!-- -->park’s 15 miles of Lake Michigan beaches give way to impressive dunes, and blowouts, marshes, wetlands, and groves of black oak savanna and maple sugar trees. It became a national park in 2019.</p><h2 class="RxNCg SbJgJ ykkUm PvZ nIjPJ PMXYp LmsHF SfAHY mNgye lNbol LBPRq rBLIK ">60.<!-- --> <a class="zZygg UbGlr iFzkS qdXbA WCDhQ DbOXS tqUtK GpWVU iJYzE " data-testid="prism-linkbase" href="https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/national-parks/article/gateway-arch-guide-what-to-do-when-to-go" target="_blank" dir="ltr">Gateway Arch National Park</a>, Missouri</h2><div class="oLzSq QrHMO fnRUo pvsTF EhJPu vPlOC zNYgW OsTsW RMeqy daRVX ISNQ sKyCY eRftA acPPc MENS nFwaT MCnQE mEeeY SmBjI xegrY rPLsU iulOd NIuqO zzscu lzDCc aHUBM IEgzD OjMNy eQqcx SVqKB GQmdz jaoD VWDdR ONJdw vrZxD OnRTz gbbfF roDbV GPGwb oMlSS gfNzt oJhud eXZcf zhVlX "><div><div class="InlineImage GpQCA lZur asrEW " data-testid="prism-inline-image"><figure class="kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO " data-testid="prism-figure"><div class="GpQCA lZur " style="padding-bottom:66.40625%" data-testid="prism-ratio-frame"><div class="FvQLF iLTd NqeUA UzzHi iWsMV "><div class="lZur TmzDJ bmjsw " data-testid="prism-copyright-wrapper"><picture data-testid="prism-picture"><source media="(max-width: 374px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=374&amp;h=248, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=748&amp;h=496 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 375px) and (max-width: 413px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=413&amp;h=274, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=826&amp;h=548 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 414px) and (max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=767&amp;h=509, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=1534&amp;h=1018 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=1024&amp;h=680, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=2048&amp;h=1360 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1440px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=1440&amp;h=956&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=2880&amp;h=1912&amp;q=90 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1441px) and (max-width: 1920px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1275&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=3840&amp;h=2550&amp;q=90 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1921px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=2500&amp;h=1660&amp;q=90, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg?w=5000&amp;h=3320&amp;q=90 2x"/><img alt="of the St. Louis Gateway Arch in St. Louis, Missouri" class="ArticleBodyLazyImg hsDdd NDJZt sJeUN IJwXl vBqtr UbGlr SjwtZ " data-testid="prism-image" draggable="false" loading="lazy" src="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/1dafbc00-6dc7-4549-a561-84ff0b11eeb8/gateway-arch-st-louis-missouri.jpg" id="Gateway Arch National Park, Missouri" decoding="async"/></picture></div></div></div><button aria-label="Open image in fullscreen" class="mLASH egFzk qXWHA ScoIf XbEWk jIRH nkbp OJpwZ hUQGO wSPfd ofvJb lIDy YIauu gGlNh ARCOA kyjTO xqlN gWRci aNnIu GDslh LjPJo UDizh gHvnI RpDvg YYtC rTpcz EDgo UVTAB hswTp sXtkB AAqU fctVp ENhiS xjUSk NatTH NqeUA dZTKY QMxMQ LpcJi wardV kcRqD fhCRd MYLFX RkJsE iEOQC yaNWn ZUpvj HoXXr " data-testid="prism-ImageViewer_ExpandButton" type="button"><span class="CSJky HNIED JSFPu "><svg aria-hidden="true" class=" " data-testid="prism-iconography" height="1em" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" data-icon="view-fullscreenEnter"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.48 11.24V16h3.04V9.52H16V6.48H6.48v4.76M32 8v1.52h6.48V16h3.04V6.48H32V8M6.48 36.76v4.76H16v-3.04H9.52V32H6.48v4.76m32-1.52v3.24H32v3.04h9.52V32h-3.04v3.24"/></svg></span></button><figcaption><div class="nMMea bNYiy Mjgpa dGwha DDmxa jgKNG RGHCC aBIU PriDW aiQHS lZur " data-testid="prism-caption"><div class="HXPPJ barbu yKsXL IzgMt VcHIt uhSzI YGNMU cRAsZ xqMcl QtRul "><span class="hsDdd OOSI GpQCA lZur VlFaz " data-testid="prism-truncate"><span><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ "> St. Louis Gateway Arch located in Gateway Arch National Park, Missouri</span></span></span></div><div class="qinlA IpWvx oqZz tylGM lyWxS nWcVF UhTug PPcLh YxlyB "><span class="gtOSm FbbUW tUtYa vOCwz EQwFq yCufu eEak Qmvg nyTIa SRXVc vzLa jgBfc WXDas CiUCW kqbG zrdEG txGfn ygKVe BbezD UOtxr CVfpq xijV soGRS XgdC sEIlf daWqJ YNujN JGtjI aZFDu rkKLh ">Photograph by Adam Olson, Alamy Stock Photo</span></div></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><p class="EkqkG IGXmU nlgHS yuUao lqtkC TjIXL aGjvy ">Gateway Arch National Park<!-- --> <!-- -->has been many things: a monument to Thomas Jefferson’s historic frontier, a commemoration of Lewis and Clark’s epic expedition—and, most recently, the U.S.’s 60th national park.<!-- --> </p><h2 class="RxNCg SbJgJ ykkUm PvZ nIjPJ PMXYp LmsHF SfAHY mNgye lNbol LBPRq rBLIK ">61.<!-- --> <a class="zZygg UbGlr iFzkS qdXbA WCDhQ DbOXS tqUtK GpWVU iJYzE " data-testid="prism-linkbase" href="https://www.nps.gov/neri/index.htm" target="_blank" dir="ltr">New River Gorge National Park and Preserve</a>, West Virginia</h2><div class="oLzSq QrHMO fnRUo pvsTF EhJPu vPlOC zNYgW OsTsW RMeqy daRVX ISNQ sKyCY eRftA acPPc MENS nFwaT MCnQE mEeeY SmBjI xegrY rPLsU iulOd NIuqO zzscu lzDCc aHUBM IEgzD OjMNy eQqcx SVqKB GQmdz jaoD VWDdR ONJdw vrZxD OnRTz gbbfF roDbV GPGwb oMlSS gfNzt oJhud eXZcf zhVlX "><div><div class="InlineImage GpQCA lZur asrEW " data-testid="prism-inline-image"><figure class="kzIjN GNmeK pYrtp dSqFO " data-testid="prism-figure"><div class="GpQCA lZur " style="padding-bottom:67.125%" data-testid="prism-ratio-frame"><div class="FvQLF iLTd NqeUA UzzHi iWsMV "><div class="lZur TmzDJ bmjsw " data-testid="prism-copyright-wrapper"><picture data-testid="prism-picture"><source media="(max-width: 374px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=374&amp;h=251, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=748&amp;h=502 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 375px) and (max-width: 413px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=413&amp;h=277, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=826&amp;h=554 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 414px) and (max-width: 767px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=767&amp;h=515, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=1534&amp;h=1030 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=1024&amp;h=687, https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=2048&amp;h=1374 2x"/><source media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1440px)" srcSet="https://i.natgeofe.com/n/b1c7ad58-5e90-45ba-aa6f-9737b8b4a384/NationalGeographic_2170925.jpg?w=1440&amp;h=967&amp;q=